<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40217" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Quintĭus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Quinct-</span></b> ), i, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the name of a
			Roman</i> gens. Thus, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			L. Quintius Cincinnatus, <i><span class="en">Liv. 3,
				26, 8 sq.</span></i>— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> T. Quintius Flaminius, <i><span class="en">Liv. 32,
				10, 7</span></i>.— Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Quintĭus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Quinct-</span></b> ), a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a Quintius</i>, <i>Quintian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in Quintiā gente,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 3,
					12</span></i>
			: prata, <i>at Rome</i>, <i>beyond
				the Tiber</i>, <i>named after</i> L. Quintius
			Cincinnatus, <i><span class="en">id. 3, 26</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 4,
				4, 7</span></i>; Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest. p.
				256</span></i> Müll.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Quintĭānus</span></b> 
				(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Quinct-</span></b> ),
				a, um, adj., <i>of</i>
			or <i>belonging to a Quintius</i>, <i>Quintian</i>: Quintianus exercitus, <i>commanded
				by</i> L. Quintius Cincinnatus, <i><span class="en">Liv. 3,
			28</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">judicia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Clu. 41, 113</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
